        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

<!-- Tutorial Modal -->
<div class="tutorial-modal-backdrop" id="tutorial-modal" onclick="if(event.target===this)closeTutorialModal()">
  <div class="tutorial-modal" onclick="event.stopPropagation()">
    <div class="tutorial-modal-header">
      <div class="tutorial-modal-title">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="22" height="22"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 015.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2.5"/></svg>
        使用说明
      </div>
      <button class="tutorial-close-btn" onclick="closeTutorialModal()">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="tutorial-cards">
      <div class="tutorial-card">
        <div class="tutorial-card-icon novel">📖</div>
        <div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-badge novel">小说模式</div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-title">从小说生成分镜</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tutorial-card-desc">将小说文本直接转化为视频分镜脚本，AI 自动拆解场景与对白。</div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:4px">
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num novel">1</div><span>在「创建」页选择 <strong style="color:#c7d2fe">小说模式</strong></span></div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num novel">2</div><span>将小说文本 <strong style="color:#c7d2fe">粘贴</strong> 到输入框</span></div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num novel">3</div><span>点击生成，AI 自动拆解场景</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tutorial-card">
        <div class="tutorial-card-icon video">🎬</div>
        <div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-badge video">视频模式</div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-title">从视频提取分镜</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tutorial-card-desc">上传已有视频，AI 自动识别场景并生成对应的分镜脚本。</div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:4px">
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num video">1</div><span>在「创建」页选择 <strong style="color:#fbcfe8">视频模式</strong></span></div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num video">2</div><span>将视频文件 <strong style="color:#fbcfe8">拖入</strong> 上传区域</span></div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num video">3</div><span>AI 自动分析视频并提取场景</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tutorial-card">
        <div class="tutorial-card-icon create">✨</div>
        <div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-badge create">创作模式</div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-title">一句话生成分镜</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tutorial-card-desc">只需一句话描述你的创意，AI 从零开始生成完整的分镜脚本。</div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:4px">
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num create">1</div><span>在「创建」页选择 <strong style="color:#a7f3d0">创作模式</strong></span></div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num create">2</div><span><strong style="color:#a7f3d0">输入一句话</strong> 描述你的故事创意</span></div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num create">3</div><span>AI 自动创作完整分镜脚本</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tutorial-footer">点击任意空白处关闭 · 随时可从左侧导航栏重新打开</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Credit Rules Modal -->
<div class="tutorial-modal-backdrop" id="credit-rules-modal" onclick="if(event.target===this)closeCreditRulesModal()">
  <div class="tutorial-modal credit-rule" onclick="event.stopPropagation()">
    <div class="tutorial-modal-header">
      <div class="tutorial-modal-title">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="22" height="22"><path d="M12 1v22"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 000 7H14.5a3.5 3.5 0 010 7H6"/></svg>
        积分规则
      </div>
      <button class="tutorial-close-btn" onclick="closeCreditRulesModal()">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="tutorial-cards">
      <div class="tutorial-card">
        <div class="tutorial-card-icon credit">⚡</div>
        <div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-badge credit">基础规则</div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-title">新用户与扣费基准</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tutorial-card-desc">所有用户默认带初始积分，生成不同阶段按不同维度扣费。</div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:4px">
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num credit">1</div><span>每个新用户初始赠送 <strong style="color:#fde68a">100 积分</strong></span></div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num credit">2</div><span>剧本/分镜阶段：<strong style="color:#fde68a">1 秒视频 = 1 积分</strong></span></div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num credit">3</div><span>参考图：<strong style="color:#fde68a">1 张图 = 2 积分</strong></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tutorial-card">
        <div class="tutorial-card-icon redeem">🎟️</div>
        <div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-badge redeem">充值方式</div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-title">兑换码充值与记录</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tutorial-card-desc">普通用户可在账户面板输入兑换码，管理员可后台批量生成和监控使用情况。</div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:4px">
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num redeem">1</div><span>在账户面板输入 <strong style="color:#67e8f9">兑换码</strong> 可增加积分</span></div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num redeem">2</div><span>普通用户可查看 <strong style="color:#67e8f9">积分记录</strong></span></div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num redeem">3</div><span>管理员可查看 <strong style="color:#67e8f9">用户积分监控</strong></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tutorial-card">
        <div class="tutorial-card-icon proxy">🪄</div>
        <div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-badge proxy">视频生成</div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-title">代理模式与视频扣费</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tutorial-card-desc">视频生成阶段区分普通模式和即梦代理模式，critic/rewrite 也会单独计费。</div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:4px">
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num proxy">1</div><span>每次 <strong style="color:#d8b4fe">critic + rewrite</strong> 扣 5 积分</span></div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num proxy">2</div><span>非代理模式：<strong style="color:#d8b4fe">1 秒视频 = 5 积分</strong></span></div>
          <div class="tutorial-card-step"><div class="tutorial-card-step-num proxy">3</div><span>即梦代理模式：<strong style="color:#d8b4fe">视频生成免费</strong></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tutorial-footer">点击任意空白处关闭 · 可随时从左侧导航栏「积分」按钮重新打开</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="user-menu-modal-backdrop" id="user-menu-modal" onclick="if(event.target===this)closeUserMenu()">
  <div class="user-menu-modal" onclick="event.stopPropagation()">
    <div class="user-menu-header">
      <div class="user-menu-title">
        <div class="user-menu-avatar" id="user-menu-avatar">U</div>
        <div>
          <h3 id="user-menu-name">账户</h3>
          <div class="user-menu-subtitle" id="user-menu-role">普通用户</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="user-menu-actions">
        <button onclick="closeUserMenu()">关闭</button>
        <button class="danger-btn" onclick="logout()">退出登录</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="user-menu-grid">
      <div class="user-menu-card">
        <h4>当前会话</h4>
        <div class="user-menu-meta">
          <div class="user-menu-meta-row">
            <span>用户名</span>
            <strong id="user-menu-name-meta">当前账户</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="user-menu-meta-row">
            <span>角色</span>
            <strong id="user-menu-role-meta">-</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="user-menu-card">
        <h4>生成 Session</h4>
        <div class="user-menu-meta">
          <div class="user-menu-meta-row">
            <span>当前用户</span>
            <strong id="user-session-owner">-</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="user-menu-meta-row">
            <span id="user-session-backend-label">即梦 Session</span>
            <strong id="user-session-summary">未设置</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="user-menu-actions" style="margin-top:12px">
          <button type="button" onclick="openProxyCookieModal()">设置 Session</button>
          <button type="button" class="danger-btn" onclick="logout()">退出登录</button>
        </div>
        <div class="inline-note" style="margin-top:12px">
          登录后每个用户都可以保存自己的生成 Session。提交视频任务时会自动使用当前账号已保存的 Session。
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="user-menu-card" style="margin-top:16px">
      <h4>积分</h4>
      <div class="credits-balance-row">
        <div class="credits-balance-value" id="user-credits-balance">--</div>
        <div class="credits-balance-label">当前余额</div>
      </div>
      <div class="credits-actions">
        <input id="redeem-code-input" type="text" placeholder="输入兑换码" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
        <button type="button" onclick="redeemCode()">兑换</button>
        <button type="button" onclick="toggleCreditsHistory()">积分记录</button>
      </div>
      <div class="credits-status" id="redeem-status"></div>
      <div id="credits-history-panel" class="credits-history-panel hidden">
        <div id="credits-history-list"></div>
        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:8px">
          <button type="button" onclick="loadMoreCreditsHistory()" id="credits-history-more-btn" class="credits-more-btn hidden">加载更多</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="admin-panel hidden" id="admin-panel">
      <div class="admin-panel-header">
        <div>
          <h4 class="admin-panel-title">管理员用户管理</h4>
          <div class="admin-panel-note">支持创建用户、启用/禁用账号，以及重置用户密码。</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="admin-create-form">
        <input id="admin-create-username" type="text" placeholder="新用户名" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
        <input id="admin-create-password" type="password" placeholder="初始密码（至少 8 位）" autocomplete="new-password">
        <select id="admin-create-role">
          <option value="user">普通用户</option>
          <option value="admin">管理员</option>
        </select>
        <button type="button" onclick="createAdminUser()">创建用户</button>
      </div>
      <div class="admin-users-list" id="admin-users-list"></div>

      <div class="admin-section-divider">
        <h4>兑换码管理</h4>
        <div class="admin-create-form" style="grid-template-columns: auto auto 1fr 1fr">
          <input id="admin-redeem-count" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="10" placeholder="数量">
          <input id="admin-redeem-credits" type="number" min="1" value="50" placeholder="积分">
          <button type="button" onclick="generateRedeemCodes()">批量生成</button>
          <button type="button" onclick="loadRedeemCodes()">刷新列表</button>
        </div>
        <div class="credits-status" id="admin-redeem-status"></div>
        <div id="admin-redeem-list" style="max-height:200px;overflow:auto"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="admin-section-divider">
        <h4>用户积分监控</h4>
        <div class="user-menu-actions" style="margin-bottom:12px">
          <button type="button" onclick="loadAdminCreditsOverview()">刷新</button>
        </div>
        <div id="admin-credits-overview" style="max-height:300px;overflow:auto"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="user-menu-status" id="user-menu-status"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Proxy Cookie Modal -->
<div class="proxy-cookie-modal-backdrop" id="proxy-cookie-modal">
  <div class="proxy-cookie-modal" onclick="event.stopPropagation()">
    <h3 data-i18n="proxy.modal_title">设置视频生成 Session</h3>
    <p data-i18n="proxy.modal_desc">请粘贴即梦的 session 值，也支持粘贴完整 Cookie 字符串。系统会自动解析 sessionid / sessionid_ss，此凭证仅用于当前任务的视频生成。</p>
    <input type="text" id="proxy-cookie-input" placeholder="请直接粘贴 Session ID" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
    <div class="proxy-cookie-modal-actions">
      <button type="button" class="btn-secondary" onclick="closeProxyCookieModal(false)" data-i18n="misc.cancel">取消</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn-primary" onclick="closeProxyCookieModal(true)" data-i18n="proxy.confirm">确认</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
